    face: { type: 'none', notes: 'From photos only: no white shows on the face in the NHK Mile right-profile shot (JRA-VAN) or in the 3/4 paddock shot (Commons, 1998-11-22). No frontal photo was found, so a tiny star cannot be ruled out.' },
