    style: { primary: 'sashi', secondary: 'senko', why: 'Across his 25 graded starts his median first-corner position was about 0.31 of the field. He raced up with the pace as a classic colt: 4th of 18 into the first corner of the Satsuki Sho and in front for the whole 1998 Derby. As a sprinter-miler (late 1999 to 2000) he raced mid-pack or further back: 7-10 of 17 in the Takamatsunomiya Kinen, 15-15 of 16 in the Sprinters S. ja.wikipedia says he won his G1 by running down the leaders from the widest draw (大外から…差し切って).' },
